{"ref":"BDB, שְׁפוֹט","hw":"שְׁפוֹט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפוֹט</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> si vera l. <strong>judgment, act of judgment</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.9\">2 Ch 20:9</a> (so 𝔊 𝔖, but dub.); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפוּטִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.10\">Ez 23:10</a> (Toy <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפָטִים</span>, Co del.).","next":"BDB, שָׁפָט","prev":"BDB, שֶׁ֫פֶט"}